    "details": {
      "description": "<p>Poisonous gas built up underground bursts forth from three cracked vents in the stone. Space these out based on your battlemap, as a general rule they should be no more than 1-2 strides apart from each other. The hazard's \"area\" is the entire map.</p><p>Creatures with the Stonewyrm Touched adjustment (Appendix A) are immune to this hazard.</p>",
      "disable": "<p>@Check[survival|dc:23|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Survival}, @Check[crafting|dc:23|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Crafting}, @Check[thievery|dc:23|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Thievery} or @Check[nature|dc:23|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Nature} to block off one of the vents.</p><p>All three vents must be successfully disabled or brought to their broken threshold (half HP) to completely shut off the hazard.</p>",
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 8
      },
      "publication": {
        "authors": "",
        "license": "OGL",
        "remaster": false,
        "title": "Covalon: Whitespire Expedition"
      },
      "reset": "<p>The poisonous gas takes 1 day to reaccumulate. </p>",
      "routine": "<p>(1 action) Poison continues to spew from the remaining vents. Creatures in the area must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:26|traits:inhaled,poison,primal,magical] save. The DC is lowered by 2 for each vent successfully disabled (or broken). As noted in the inhaled trait, a creature can use an action on its turn to hold its breath and gain a +2 circumstance bonus to this save.</p><p>One vent disabled: @Check[fortitude|dc:24|traits:inhaled,poison,primal,magical], Two vents disabled: @Check[fortitude|dc:22|traits:inhaled,poison,primal,magical]</p><hr><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half of @Damage[(5d6)[poison]] damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round as stone scales begin to manifest on its skin.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure </strong>The creature takes doubled damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} for 1 round.</p>"
    },
